      en: ["Narayanganj was established as a municipality in the year 1876.", "The port of Narayanganj was officially opened for trade in 1880.", "It was home to Adamjee Jute Mills, once the world's largest jute factory.", "The 17th-century Hajiganj Fort was built to protect the area from river pirates.", "Narayanganj is a primary center for the trade of hand-loomed Jamdani saris.", "The city has one of the highest densities of knitwear factories globally."],
